# Prettier is configured for LF (its default `endOfLine: "lf"`), but without
# this file a Windows checkout lands CRLF on disk and `npm run format:check`
# fails locally on files nobody touched — while CI, which checks out on Linux,
# passes. Normalise on checkout so both agree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending normalised.
*.webp binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png  binary
*.ico  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
